# VS Code Extension Reference

This reference is generated from `ide/vscode/package.json` and includes contributed commands and settings.

## Activation model

The extension activates on these triggers:

- `onCommand:loom.openChat`
- `onView:loom.chatView`
- `onCommand:loom.explainSelection`
- `onCommand:loom.refactorSelection`

## Generated inventory

<SurfaceTable title="Commands" rows={commandRows} />

<SurfaceTable title="Settings" rows={settingRows} />

## Full extension surface

<SurfaceTable rows={rows} />

<Callout variant="tip" title="Keybinding">
	`loom.openChat` ships with `Ctrl+Shift+L` on Windows/Linux and `Cmd+Shift+L` on macOS.
</Callout>
